add one switch to webview_flutter to control whether it is interactive or not

### Use case

when use WebView_flutter in web, we can't interact with the area of flutter that on top of webview, so we need to use PointerInterceptor as talked in [URL]

but i think WebView_flutter should have a switch to control interactive it self, and when it is not interactive, engine can do a lot optimize, maybe there is no need to copy the picture of webview or pass use input to it;

### Proposal

PlatformView is very expressive, as it need to copy texture and react to user input; if one platform view is inactive, maybe it can be put on bottom or top of flutter to avoid copy, as multi-view is coming, this is more available. as webview_flutter is a special PlatfromView, and not always need to be interactive, so I suggest to add such switch, so that we can use webview_flutter more efficient;

