Flutter dashboard golden-files should support Mac or use Skia Gold

Golden-file matching in flutter/cocoon uses local-file comparison, but only runs on Linux [URL].

This means with a Mac or WIndows machine, I cannot make any UI-impacting changes to coocon without getting another machine. Either it should be:

- possible to use any machine to generate these golden files;
- the golden files should be removed entirely;
- checking the goldens should be moved to a bringup task that can be fixed periodically;
- ... or, Skia Gold should be used like it is on our other repos

